{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yqqthXqVQ91794999654.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名女子去年公開質疑一名醫生女兒研發的「藥倍安心」應用程式，涉嫌「請槍」，並公開對方個人資料，被警方落案，控告四項「起底罪」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HAILEY-1600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o5HZAwd7iE1794999722.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>涉案的是一名姓鄭的25歲女子，她去年6月至10月曾在社交網站帖文，公開質疑肝癌權威潘冬平的女兒多次獲獎的AI應用程式「藥倍安心」非對方獨自研發，並涉嫌在多個社交平台發布針對對方及其家人的「起底」及評論帖文。</p><p></p><p>警方今年二月將其拘捕，經深入調查後，落案起訴她四項「未獲資料當事人同意下披露其個人資料，而該披露造成指明傷害」罪，下午在東區裁判法院提堂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:01.260642+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:17:37.341258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:16.917319+00:00","content_hash":"3f6d84a56bae9bc886f85c8bcd8213f6f23e4254c6adb4784e23964e234d0906","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:01.260642+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}